# Dumps of real NMOS nodes captured for conformance checking.
#
# These carry a real broadcaster's node and resource identifiers, their
# multicast plan, interface addressing and MAC addresses. They are kept locally
# because diffing our IS-04/IS-05 output against working third-party kit is the
# only reliable way to catch conformance defects -- but none of it goes into the
# repository.
#
# This file lives beside the captures rather than only in the root .gitignore so
# the rule travels with the folder if it is ever moved or copied.
nmos_capture_*/
nmos_capture*

# Anything else dumped alongside them.
*.sdp
*.json

# The dump script itself is ours and is worth keeping.
!nmosdump.py
!.gitignore
